omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D_9uJITnVksQ7kNvwFQhWD0&_nc_oc=Adrd0aZ1qhY3FysoD5CG6HQ4bo6hkfHo9sdda1M_VJ0YDa0vk7T8xCdC22WRqrzNS6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOGMTlHTtxV9he28509DtHhXlvc5JCebOGGsHwhOHM6Hw&oe=6AC663B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GC5noq2-5B0Q7kNvwHtSh_a&_nc_oc=Adormzj7vmh_SDP4y9qZXORWSg-85L8XnOrZmcm3No1x1W2YgXAznvc4sYgZgCD-XPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQND0lfii4xcLBOV03_CGSGTAR46LtjIFcKEbKVyhNgoYg&oe=6AC66516"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5BFpJNNA-gQ7kNvwFhIz1C&_nc_oc=Adq0PuaJVmIz0fRkDSOoarmy5ETcpJP6RIe1VUTu4TbhIJYbEn9Q22iPAE63_LLLSfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMK5pts9V-QzG98EvOvuiWgh-OwfPS3lbjCIsuqFZuKvg&oe=6AC641F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://